test_mcp_docker	Build and push	2026-10-22T15:17:48.9731602Z             "body": "This draft preserves the original local stdio MCP and adds bounded batch/jobs, private profiles/artifacts, production packaging, lifecycle checks, and native regression evidence. Release acceptance remains blocked.\n\nThe pinned VP9 encoder now declares BT.709 primaries alongside its existing smpte170m matrix. Native88 actual Mac WebKit recording passes the unchanged320×240 decoded-red threshold and six-click assertion. Eleven of twelve native cases pass for each PCM and WebM; Windows WebKit still fails readiness after valid byte-range responses. No codec-support waiver or assertion/deadline change is included. Prepared core SHA256: 3eb68a089871529d6dccd723546bc87e20299047e140d382dc5fe380b1350192.\n\nNative88 at702b616: completed summaries1717 passes/14 failures. Linux22 package/main were unexecuted after dependency installation reached the30m job limit. Mac main was cancelled with an empty log on two normal reads; direct job-log REST also returned Forbidden. Its results/cleanup remain unknown. All17 job reads were attempted;16 nonempty logs recovered. Actual Codex1k passes Linux/Windows with model0/owned0; Mac times out951. Windows input, legacy cleanup and journal failures remain. Historical136/142 PID counts and other unconfirmed exits are retained, without role/name/age filtering or debt clearance.\n\nCurrent candidate8416021 adds:\n- Independent trace/PDF cases so a screenshot failure cannot suppress their coverage; existing combined assertions remain.\n- Docker context restricted to16 required files, verified by a network-disabled scratch export with exact source bytes.\n- Queue-expiry fixture preserves storage on failure/uncertain journal close; component annotations retain only bounded allowlisted command/phase/exit facts.\n- Linux batch setup replaces only the measured slow Azure Ubuntu mirror URI with Ubuntu’s canonical HTTPS archive. Apt signatures, package requirements and30m job limit remain unchanged; native performance is pending.\n\nLocal validation: fresh297-file scripts-disabled production installation and real original/profile/batch/jobs/controller/journal/guardian checks pass. Independent trace/PDF4/4 each Node20/22/24; reporter7/7 each Node; queue case1/1 each22/24. Strict TypeScript, README generation, actionlint (shellcheck/pyflakes disabled), diff and bounded documentation checks pass. Three extracted sed fixtures preserve unrelated repositories and signing configuration.\n\nNative89 validation:\n- [Local batch QA](https://github.com/timmiballz22/playwright-mcp/actions/runs/39795946998)\n- [Original CI](https://github.com/timmiballz22/playwright-mcp/actions/runs/39795947087)\n\nExact failures, missing evidence and acceptance gates: docs/CODEX_EXECUTION_REPORT.md, docs/CODEX_EXECUTION_LEDGER.md and docs/evidence/native88-summary.json. No merge or publishing is requested while critical gates remain open.\n",
